 接收消息\nchannel.basic_consume(queue=queue_name, on_message_callback=process_message)\nprint('Waiting for messages from RabbitMQ. To exit press CTRL+C')\nchannel.start_consuming()\n```\n\n修改示例代码中的`your_rabbitmq_host`、`your_queue_name`、`your_exchange_name`、`your_routing_key`以及`your_graplog_api_key`，使其符合实际需求。然后运行此脚本：\n\n```bash\npython rabbitmq_to_graplog.py\n```\n\n脚本将一直运行并等待从 RabbitMQ 接收消息。一旦接收到消息，它将立即将消息发送到 Graplog。为了结束脚本，请按 `CTRL + C`。", "country": null, "hashed_ip": null, "header": null, "language": "Chinese", "redacted": false, "role": "assistant", "state": null, "timestamp": "2023-04-13 02:26:01+00:00", "toxic": false, "turn_identifier": 133893}], "turn": 1, "language": "Chinese", "openai_moderation": [{"categories": {"harassment": false, "harassment/threatening": false, "harassment_threatening": false, "hate": false, "hate/threatening": false, "hate_threatening": false, "self-harm": false, "self-harm/instructions": false, "self-harm/intent": false, "self_harm": false, "self_harm_instructions": false, "self_harm_intent": false, "sexual": false, "sexual/minors": false, "sexual_minors": false, "violence": false, "violence/graphic": false, "violence_graphic": false}, "category_scores": {"harassment": 3.326691148686223e-05, "harassment/threatening": 1.0707245564844925e-05, "harassment_threatening": 1.0707245564844925e-05, "hate": 4.24072532041464e-05, "hate/threatening": 1.681098410699633e-06, "hate_threatening": 1.681098410699633e-06, "self-harm": 1.058651105267927e-05, "self-harm/instructions": 1.1456679658294888e-06, "self-harm/intent": 3.1578740617987933e-06, "self_harm": 1.058651105267927e-05, "self_harm_instructions": 1.1456679658294888e-06, "self_harm_intent": 3.1578740617987933e-06, "sexual": 0.0002533289953134954, "sexual/minors": 6.335112630040385e-06, "sexual_minors": 6.335112630040385e-06, "violence": 0.00011729936522897333, "violence/graphic": 0.00028624155675061047, "violence_graphic": 0.00028624155675061047}, "flagged": false}, {"categories": {"harassm